#X msg 700 3880 >>> press GO to run step 5 of 26;
#X obj 240 3950 s \$0-say;
#X obj 20 4040 select 6;
#X obj 240 4040 t b b b;
#X msg 700 4040 === STEP-06-of-26 === Grid vocabulary stays off the OLED;
#X msg 700 4090 PASS IF: Nothing happens on either surface. In particular no parameter row called grid appears on the OLED.;
#X msg 700 4140 >>> press GO to run step 6 of 26;
