#X obj 240 4300 t b b b;
#X msg 700 4300 === STEP-07-of-26 === Modal claims the surface;
#X msg 700 4350 PASS IF: Every pad and every lamp on the top row turns blue. The mode lamps are covered too. The OLED must not change.;
#X msg 700 4400 >>> press GO to run step 7 of 26;
#X obj 240 4470 s \$0-say;
#X obj 20 4560 select 8;
#X obj 240 4560 t b b b;
#X msg 700 4560 === STEP-08-of-26 === Mode change under a modal;
#X msg 700 4610 PASS IF: Nothing happens. The surface stays blue. The mode really does change underneath and you will see it two steps from now.;
#X msg 700 4660 >>> press GO to run step 8 of 26;
