#X obj 20 4820 select 9;
#X obj 240 4820 t b b b;
#X msg 700 4820 === STEP-09-of-26 === Alert over a modal;
#X msg 700 4870 PASS IF: The surface turns red for about two seconds and then goes back to blue -- not to the mode lamps.;
