#X obj 240 5080 t b b b;
#X msg 700 5080 === STEP-10-of-26 === Clearing the modal;
#X msg 700 5130 PASS IF: The grid returns to mode lamps and the beat row. The bright lamp is now the third one -- the change made while the modal covered it.;
#X msg 700 5180 >>> press GO to run step 10 of 26;
