#X obj 20 5340 select 11;
#X obj 240 5340 t b b b;
#X msg 700 5340 === STEP-11-of-26 === A fail takes the surface;
#X msg 700 5390 PASS IF: The whole surface turns red and then goes back to the mode lamps by itself after about two seconds. A grid that stays red is the failure.;
#X msg 700 5440 >>> press GO to run step 11 of 26;
